  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Water and Sewerage Programme in Urban and Peri-Urban Areas-Bolivia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Programme is a continuation of the alliance established between the Government of Bolivia, AECID, the IDB and the EU and builds on the previous work of the Fondo de Cooperaci&#xf3;n para Agua y Saneamiento (FCAS) /AECID programmes and of the portfolio implemented by the IDB in the country. Through strategic investments in infrastructure together with improved service delivery and water resource management, resilience is strengthened in the face of drought and flood events in urban population</narrative>
  </description>
